  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 225px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 36px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 36px; border-style: none;\">\n<h1>BPSC Bihar Stenographer Admit Card 2026 Exam Notice for 15 Post</h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><strong>02 June 2026 | 06:50 PM</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 154px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 154px; border-style: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC) has released the notification for the recruitment of Stenographer Exam 2026. Those Candidates Are Interested to the Following BPSC Stenographer Exam 2026 Vacancy Can Apply Online from <strong>12/01/2026 to 02/02/2026.</strong> See the advertisement for information related to age limit, syllabus, Department wise post, selection procedure, pay scale in BPSC Stenographer Recruitment 2026.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-lazy-src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/21